{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_document", "label": "Visual Companion Auth Hardening Design (spec)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_bootstrap_keyed_loads", "label": "Bootstrap Keyed Loads", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The session key must not remain in the visible URL (history, referrers, same-origin script access); GET /?key= returns a bootstrap page that stores the key in tab-scoped sessionStorage and navigates to a bare /."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_session_storage_key", "label": "sessionStorage Reconnect Credential", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The helper needs a reconnect credential that survives same-port restarts and does not depend only on cookie behavior (headed Chrome stopped presenting the cookie after restart)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_websocket_same_origin_enforcement", "label": "WebSocket Same-Origin Enforcement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A cross-origin localhost page can open a cookie-authenticated WebSocket and write attacker-controlled choices; upgrades must pass both session auth and an Origin match against the request target host."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_files_containment", "label": "/files/* Realpath Containment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Symlinks under content/ can point outside the directory, including to state/server-info with the keyed URL; a realpath boundary (file must be a descendant of the real content dir) rejects escapes with 404."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_leak_reduction_headers", "label": "Leak-Reduction Headers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Conservative headers (no-referrer, no-store, X-Frame-Options DENY, frame-ancestors none, CORP same-origin) without a restrictive script-src CSP - the companion injects inline helper JS and future screens may load same-origin vendored libraries."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_bootstrap_keyed_loads", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-10-visual-companion-auth-hardening-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_10_visual_companion_auth_hardening_design_session_storage_key", "relation": "refe